                    <value>&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customers have shared Improved Usage Tracker Use Cases&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;WOULD YOU LIKE TO TRACK ANY OF THE FOLLOWING IN MORE DETAIL?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;USERS GEO-LOCATION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW LONG USERS SPEND ON PAGES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REPORTS &amp;amp; DASHBOARDS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SALESFORCE KNOWLEDGE ARTICLES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SALESFORCE FLOW SCREENS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OPPORTUNITY ANALYSIS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CASE ANALYSIS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CONTENT LINK TRACKING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Part of this package is the &apos;&lt;/strong&gt;Improved Apps - Improved Usage Tracker Dashboard (v2)&apos; &lt;strong&gt;Dashboard to get you going.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTE | &lt;/strong&gt;All usage data sits in this Org, there are tools to help you manage your data. e.g. You may only wish to capture a rolling number of days of usage data. This can be set in Help Settings. Learn more in the FAQ below...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improved Usage Tracker | Frequently Answered Questions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.improvedapps.com/improved-usage-tracker-faq/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Click here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; to learn more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</value>
